peers around carefully."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Shadowless","expression":8,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Keven","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Shadowless","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I've thought a lot on what he said, and perhaps he's right. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I understand and respect his decision... We're family. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I will always support him."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Shadowless","expression":8,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Keven","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"J","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Shadowless","expression":8,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Keven","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Shadowless","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That's it."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Shadowless","expression":8,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Keven","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"She lets go of J, then her gaze shifts away in feigned nonchalance as she fidgets with her hair. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"J can't tell if she's making sure they aren't overheard or trying to cover up her sheepishness."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Shadowless","expression":8,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Keven","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"J","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I'll let him know."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Shadowless","expression":8,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Keven","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Shadowless","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Thanks... Come and have dinner at our place one o